3. manager.js

This is the important part.

Because Excel files aren't guaranteed to always have exactly the same row numbers, I don't want to hard-code only A3, B3, etc. The importer searches the sheet for recognizable labels such as Contrat BAD, IDT de connexion, SIRET, RAISON SOCIALE, etc.

/* ==========================================================
   STORAGE
========================================================== */

const STORAGE_KEY =
    "gestion_traitement_manager";


const DEFAULT_AGENTS = [
    {
